{"title":"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_13\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 13</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_13\">Problem 13</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 13\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> are integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/e/f8e852e2b505362bcf91d1c2571d7a947f3b52bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2+m^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> is even, which of the following is impossible?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/7/e8738bbc91069d2db6a97b6ab9b1e13052ac4606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> are even <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/c/e4c8e8d2833664a006c9e4cd3041e9b43bf03485.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> are odd <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/b/22b30ef51318383c99b7b49f2774030c42bcb96e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44b29f9d3a94abde3804e0f1c34f521d81241e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> is even <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/2/e4215883dc2b2e01bd6ffb75fc6455b4903bfeaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44b29f9d3a94abde3804e0f1c34f521d81241e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> is odd <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2abda477073aaa00e3f3b2a35311755412b6fc0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> none of these are impossible\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jQLIxT5qCTY\">https://youtu.be/jQLIxT5qCTY</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=boXUIcEcAno\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=boXUIcEcAno</a>   ~David\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_3n4f0v6B7I\">https://youtu.be/_3n4f0v6B7I</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/e/f8e852e2b505362bcf91d1c2571d7a947f3b52bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2+m^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> is even, either both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/6006bba637eef443381fbaff768fa62d9ff41e62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f521656db779d024e6aff0f9a3771ac28d2c3db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> are even, or they are both odd. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> are either both even or both odd, since the square of an even number is even and the square of an odd number is odd. As a result, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44b29f9d3a94abde3804e0f1c34f521d81241e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> must be even. The answer, then, is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44b29f9d3a94abde3804e0f1c34f521d81241e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6e605c28d7afeb83548b32b484e9e2a21f3a71a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\text{D})}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"40\" height=\"32\" />, is odd.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can assign values of n and m as 1,3. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/6/7461ad49e2b8fd5d2396bd2316e6e990008b989c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^2 + 3^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> is 10. We can also assign values of n and m to be even, like 2 and 4. After calculating, we can determine that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/6006bba637eef443381fbaff768fa62d9ff41e62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f521656db779d024e6aff0f9a3771ac28d2c3db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> could be odd or even. Then, we can conclude that n+m is not odd. Hence our answer choice is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6e605c28d7afeb83548b32b484e9e2a21f3a71a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\text{D})}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"40\" height=\"32\" />\n- TheNerdWhoIsNerdy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8\">2014 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2014\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\